      "Id": "butcher_chat",
      "NpcKey": "LWN_story_butcher_chat",
      "NpcKeyZh": "（屠户，玩家）：来了。\n（屠户，玩家）：案板后头留了块好肉，饿了自己在锅里捞，不用给钱。",
      "Transitions": [
        {
          "PlayerKey": "LWN_story_butcher_opt_work",
