      "Id": "event_2_join",
      "NpcKey": "LWN_story_event2_join",
      "NpcKeyZh": "（打手，屠户）：老东西，这月的例钱呢？举着把破刀手都在抖！\n（屠户，打手）：滚开！再碰我案板一下，老子剁了你的爪子！",
      "Transitions": [
        {
          "PlayerKey": "LWN_story_event2_opt_help",
          "PlayerKeyZh": "[帮屠户] 光天化日砸人买卖，问过我的拳头没有？",
          "CheckType": "SkillCheck",
          "CheckTag": "thug|force",
          "NextNodeOnSuccess": "event_2_win",
          "NextNodeOnFail": "event_2_lose"
